Overall, I need to be more cautious, disciplined, and adaptable in my approach. The retail community has clearly leveled up, and I can no longer rely on the same manipulation tactics that were previously effective. By working closely with BearKing and being more selective in my trades, I believe I can navigate this transitional phase and position myself for long-term success."
